=== lock_device map[deviceId:1]
isError: false
--- text
{
  "appConnected": false,
  "deviceId": 1,
  "expiresAt": "<time>",
  "owner": "mcp:alice:<session>"
}

=== tap map[deviceId:1 elementId:e1]
isError: true
--- text
no app connected to the device (dev-1); start the app first

=== tap map[deviceId:1 xpath://Button]
isError: true
--- text
no app connected to the device (dev-1); start the app first

